$bog_figmol_deploy $mol_page
	- \Repository content the panel would push, keyed by path.
	files *
	name? \figmoldemo
	title \Figmol publish bench
	body /
		<= Note $mol_view
			sub /
				<= note @ \The files come from the generator run over a fixture site, so the panel can be tried without the editor. Publishing from here really does create a repository on the account the token belongs to.
		<= Publish $bog_figmol_deploy_publish
			files <= files
			name? <=> name? \figmoldemo
		<= Listing_title $mol_view
			sub /
				<= listing_title @ \Files to be pushed
		<= Listing $mol_list
			rows <= listing_rows /$mol_view
	File* $mol_row
		sub /
			<= File_name* $mol_view
				sub /
					<= file_name* \
			<= File_size* $mol_view
				sub /
					<= file_size* \
